## 27. Final Verdict

Do not say:

PRODUCTION READY
HIGHLY AVAILABLE
FAULT TOLERANT
ZERO DOWNTIME
DISASTER RECOVERY VERIFIED
PITR SUPPORTED

unless each exact claim has corresponding executed evidence.

Mocks, static manifests and unit tests are insufficient evidence for
those claims.
